0..71 Comment "//! `width-row` runs one width row that a machine instruction computes."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..147 Comment "//! The wrapping addition of `u32` is a machine row. A host of no block"
148..223 Comment "//! target, such as wasm, runs no block. Its driver must still run the row."
224..227 Comment "//!"
228..301 Comment "//! A host that runs blocks enters the row as a block. A host of no block"
302..375 Comment "//! target calls the host for the row. Both drivers give the same answer."
376..444 Comment "//! `gandr run width-row.gandr` exits 2, because the sum wraps to 2."
445..448 Comment "//!"
449..522 Comment "//! - see: `.config/wasm/cases.txt` — the wasm driver runs this program"
524..576 Comment "// - see: #8300 — the wasm driver runs a width row"
578..605 Comment "// The native finite lists."
